# name: microsoft-teams-meetings
# priority: 4730
# section: microsoft
# description: Teams 会议及 Skype for Business 共用通信入口
# boundary: 专用产品域和官方通信媒体网段先匹配；不扩到全部 Microsoft IP。Lync 与部分媒体为共用通信服务，不能凭相同入口区分发起应用
# created-at: 2026-11-19T11:46:30Z
# updated-at: 2026-11-21T02:38:40Z
# source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/enterprise/urls-and-ip-address-ranges
# source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/privacy/manage-windows-11-endpoints
# canonical-rule-count: 10
# rule-count: 10
# format: shadowrocket
# canonical: rules/loon/4730-microsoft-teams-meetings.lsr

DOMAIN,teams.live.com
DOMAIN,statics.teams.cdn.live.net
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.lync.com
IP-CIDR,52.112.0.0/14,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,52.122.0.0/15,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2603:1063::/38,no-resolve
DOMAIN,teams.cloud.microsoft
DOMAIN,teams.microsoft.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.teams.cloud.microsoft
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*.teams.microsoft.com
